    "description": "This data set contains exemplary video files of defibrillation attempts. The recordings show pig and rabbit hearts. A processed optical signal is shown depicting changes of the membrane voltage and dominant frequency maps are shown for 1s time windows accordingly. For details on the measurements and the analysis please refer to the PhD thesis by H. tom W\u00f6rden given in the references. (2018)",
